---
import { fundingRoutes } from '../config/site';
import Folio from './Folio.astro';
---

<section class="section bottleneck on-ink" id="why" aria-labelledby="why-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    <Folio num="02" label="The real obstacle" />

    <h2 id="why-title" class="display bottleneck__title" data-lines>
      <span class="line" style="--i:0"><span>You already know real estate</span></span>
      <span class="line" style="--i:1"><span>builds wealth. The hard part</span></span>
      <span class="line" style="--i:2"><span>is <em>paying for it.</em></span></span>
    </h2>

    <div class="bottleneck__grid">
      <div class="prose bottleneck__prose" data-reveal>
        <p>
          Savings run out fast, and your personal credit can only carry so much. That’s where most plans to invest stall,
          not for lack of ambition.
        </p>
        <p>
          The bootcamp’s answer is a second engine: a properly set-up business with credit in its own name, and the
          funding that credit can help you go after.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="routes">
        <p class="mono routes__head" data-reveal>Funding routes covered on the day</p>
        <ol role="list" class="routes__list">
          {
            fundingRoutes.map((r, i) => (
              <li class="routes__item" data-reveal style={`--i:${i}`}>
                <span class="mono routes__num">R.{String(i + 1).padStart(2, '0')}</span>
                <span class="routes__name display">{r}</span>
              </li>
            ))
          }
          <li class="routes__item routes__item--more" data-reveal style={`--i:${fundingRoutes.length}`}>
            <span class="mono routes__num">R.{String(fundingRoutes.length + 1).padStart(2, '0')}</span>
            <span class="routes__name display"><em>and more</em></span>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .bottleneck__title {
    margin-top: clamp(40px, 5vw, 72px);
    font-size: var(--step-4);
    text-wrap: balance;
  }
  .bottleneck__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 5fr) minmax(0, 7fr);
    gap: clamp(40px, 6vw, 120px);
    margin-top: clamp(56px, 7vw, 112px);
    align-items: start;
  }
  .bottleneck__prose {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: var(--step-1);
    line-height: 1.55;
    position: sticky;
    top: calc(var(--header-h) + 32px);
  }
  .routes__head {
    color: var(--muted);
    padding-bottom: 16px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--on-ink);
  }
  .routes__item {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 4.5rem 1fr;
    align-items: baseline;
    padding: clamp(14px, 1.6vw, 22px) 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .routes__num {
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .routes__name {
    font-size: var(--step-3);
    line-height: 1.05;
    transition:
      transform 600ms var(--ease-out),
      color 400ms ease;
  }
  .routes__item:hover .routes__name {
    transform: translateX(12px);
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .routes__item--more .routes__name {
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .bottleneck__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .bottleneck__prose {
      position: static;
    }
    .routes__item {
      grid-template-columns: 3.5rem 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
